00:12:13.680 --> 00:12:15.280
my rent, I got

00:12:15.280 --> 00:12:20.280
there's a thing called section
eight that I finally got

00:12:20.310 --> 00:12:22.363
after many of years.

00:12:23.710 --> 00:12:24.543
And

00:12:27.320 --> 00:12:31.113
that makes my rent down
to like 200 a month.

00:12:32.000 --> 00:12:35.910
And one thing I used to
dream about is I always

00:12:35.910 --> 00:12:39.500
wanted a room with a view
of the skyline because

00:12:39.500 --> 00:12:41.590
I love this city.

00:12:41.590 --> 00:12:46.590
And, and I actually got
a view, of the skyline

00:12:46.810 --> 00:12:49.683
with a full kitchen, full shower bedroom.

00:12:51.100 --> 00:12:53.373
And, but yet it's still hard to,

00:12:55.480 --> 00:12:56.313
there's a lot

00:12:56.313 --> 00:13:01.160
of things that they didn't
to live normal is very

00:13:01.160 --> 00:13:05.270
it's still a learning
process after two years.

00:13:05.270 --> 00:13:08.070
I'm still having problems,
you know, realizing

00:13:08.070 --> 00:13:10.150
that you gotta do your dishes,

00:13:10.150 --> 00:13:12.980
you gotta mop your floor

00:13:12.980 --> 00:13:14.592
and

00:13:14.592 --> 00:13:15.921
you know.

00:13:15.921 --> 00:13:17.190
But

00:13:17.190 --> 00:13:19.273
- [Interviewer] Do you
describe yourself as happy?

00:13:24.030 --> 00:13:24.863
- No

00:13:26.610 --> 00:13:27.443
No.

00:13:27.443 --> 00:13:29.080
I'm,

00:13:29.080 --> 00:13:30.090
I'm actually

